Accordingly, it is directed that applicant - Poonamchand shall be released on bail in connection with Crime, as mentioned in first paragraph of this order, upon furnishing a personal bond in the sum of Rs. 1,50,000/-(Rupees One lac and Fifty Thousand only) with one surety of the same amount to the satisfaction of the trial Court, for compliance with the following conditions : (For convenience of understanding by accused and surety, the conditions of bail are also reproduced in Hindi as under):-
Poonamchand Patidar vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 6 January, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/160989882/
2 (1) Applicant shall remain present on every date of hearing as may be directed by the concerned court;

